I definitions.inc

# push：成功推送后本地五项状态（工作目录/stage/.gitlet 本地分支/HEAD）零变化
> init
<<<
+ a.txt mcur.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "local work"
<<<
# 再制造一个已 add 未 commit 的暂存项，推送后必须原样保留
+ b.txt mgiven.txt
> add b.txt
<<<

C remote
> init
<<<
C
> add-remote origin remote/.gitlet
<<<

> push origin master
<<<

# 当前分支仍是 master，stage 中 b.txt 仍在 Branches/Staged Files 里，
# 本地分支指针停在 local work（最新提交块，不包含来自远程的任何东西）
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===
b.txt

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<

# 本地工作目录两个文件都在
= a.txt mcur.txt
= b.txt mgiven.txt

# 本地 log 只有两个提交块，远程跟踪指针不应被 push 创建
> log
${COMMIT_LOG}
${COMMIT_LOG}
<<<*
* .gitlet/refs/remotes/origin/master
